    "details": "<p><strong data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"186\">About</strong></p>\n<p>KERNEL PRIME'26 is a 24-hour offline hackathon organized by the Departments of ECE &amp; EE (VLSI Design &amp; Technology), S.A. Engineering College, Chennai. Build innovative solutions, solve real-world challenges, and compete for exciting prizes.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u3t1k8\" data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"454\">Event Details</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"608\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1atz4zo\" data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"487\"><strong data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"469\">Date:</strong> October 8&ndash;9, 2026</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"t2h97k\" data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"510\"><strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"502\">Mode:</strong> Offline</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lfux50\" data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"542\"><strong data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"530\">Team Size:</strong> 2&ndash;4 Members</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ns1b6n\" data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"579\"><strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"559\">Tracks:</strong> Hardware &amp; Software</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14gm1xc\" data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"608\"><strong data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"600\">Prize Pool:</strong> ₹50,000</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9ucpt7\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"625\">Eligibility</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"841\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1jnnqbd\" data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"680\">Open to engineering students from external colleges.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pqse2i\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"745\">Teams must have <strong data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"714\">2&ndash;4 members</strong> from the <strong data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"744\">same institution</strong>.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"7p4k7f\" data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"783\">Inter-department teams are allowed.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jqfi1m\" data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"841\"><strong data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"841\">S.A. Engineering College students are not eligible.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pt7jnx\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"864\">Selection Process</h3>\n<ol data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"1071\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1imqop5\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"890\">Register online (Free)</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4zob5y\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"943\">Submit an <strong data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"927\">Open Innovation PPT</strong> (Max. 6 slides)</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qjmc50\" data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"977\">Shortlisting based on proposal</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8pfji6\" data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1019\">Selected teams pay <strong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1019\">₹1,000 per team</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"luvcqr\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1071\">Participate in the <strong data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1071\">24-hour offline hackathon</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nd0btj\" data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1091\">Hardware Track</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1209\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3538p\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1158\">Hardware problem statements released <strong data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1147\">1 day before</strong> the event.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jxo7sf\" data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1209\">Teams must bring their own components and tools.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1piappi\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1229\">Software Track</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1344\">\n<li data-section-id=\"l082en\" data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1281\">Problem statements shared with shortlisted teams.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"sfsc55\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1344\">Develop and present a working solution during the hackathon.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gqbg7u\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1364\">PPT Submission</h3>\n<p>Submit a <strong data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1397\">maximum 6-slide PPT</strong> covering:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1517\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1jylldy\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1427\">Problem Statement</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ipxre9\" data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1447\">Proposed Solution</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"zno41x\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1460\">Innovation</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ncuxl9\" data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1481\">Technical Approach</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"msggfn\" data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1495\">Feasibility</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"84v2g9\" data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1517\">Implementation Plan</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"78015n\" data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1528\">Rules</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1685\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1smqwag\" data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1551\">One team, one track.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"9iekhf\" data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1593\">Projects must match the selected track.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"7lkejd\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1651\">Plagiarism or misconduct will lead to disqualification.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"2z1zce\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1685\">Judges' decision will be final.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1727\">Think. Build. Innovate. Be the Core.<br /></strong></p>",
